{"id":"healthcare~full_healthcare_kn_023","trace":{"trace_id":"full_healthcare_kn_023","synthesis_mode":"combined","asset_reference":{"domain_id":"healthcare","domain_version":"v1","workflow_id":"appointment_scheduling","workflow_version":"v1","tool_schema_version":"v1","domain_fingerprint":"31a5ec906f078281"},"capability_labels":{"AX005-SA006-V004":"Tool Use > Multi-Tool Execution Coordination > Result-to-Input Propagation","AX005-SA004-V001":"Tool Use > Tool Response Construction > Tool Output Grounding"},"zen_prompt":"You are the customer service representative for HEALTHCARE.\n\nYou handle these workflows. Which one a call turns out to be is something you work out from what the customer says:\n- appointment_scheduling: Book, reschedule and cancel outpatient consultations against real doctor availability.\n- insurance_preauth: Progress cashless pre-authorisation for planned and emergency admissions against policy limits.\n\nBusiness context:\n- appointment_scheduling: Indian multi-speciality hospital contact centre. Patients call about slots, reports and cashless approvals; clinical advice is out of scope and must be refused.\n- insurance_preauth: Indian multi-speciality hospital contact centre. Patients call about slots, reports and cashless approvals; clinical advice is out of scope and must be refused.\n\nAuthoritative business rules, by the workflow they bind:\n  [appointment_scheduling]\n  - No clinical advice: The agent must never suggest a diagnosis, a medicine or whether a symptom is serious. It may only route to a department.\n  - Slot truth: Only slots returned by check_doctor_availability may be offered; never an approximate day.\n  - Registration first: An unregistered patient cannot be booked; registration must be completed first.\n  - Fee disclosure: The consultation fee quoted must be the one the slot carries.\n  [insurance_preauth]\n  - No approval promise: Only the insurer approves. The agent may say a request was submitted, never that it will be approved.\n  - Network gate: Cashless is only available at a network hospital; otherwise the claim is reimbursement.\n  - Balance truth: The payable estimate must come from the policy balance and the package estimate, never from arithmetic the agent invents.\n  - Waiting period: A procedure inside an active waiting period cannot be submitted as cashless.\n\nTools available to you (7): book_appointment, check_doctor_availability, estimate_procedure_cost, lookup_patient_record, lookup_policy_coverage, submit_preauth_request, verify_customer_identity\nNot every tool applies to every call. Choosing the wrong one is an error even when the call succeeds.\n\nConversation language: kn-IN. Script policy: NATIVE_WITH_ROMAN_ENGLISH.","model_visible_tools":[{"name":"book_appointment","description":"Confirm a consultation slot and issue a booking reference.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^PT-[0-9]{4}$"},"slot_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["patient_id","slot_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"booking_ref":{"type":"string"},"doctor":{"type":"string"},"day":{"type":"string"},"time":{"type":"string"},"fee":{"type":"integer"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["confirmed","waitlisted"]}},"required":["booking_ref","doctor","day","time","status"]},"consequential":true},{"name":"check_doctor_availability","description":"List free consultation slots for a doctor or department over the next days.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"department":{"type":"string"},"days_ahead":{"type":"integer","enum":[3,7,14]}},"required":["department","days_ahead"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"department":{"type":"string"},"slots":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"slot_id":{"type":"string"},"doctor":{"type":"string"},"day":{"type":"string"},"time":{"type":"string"},"fee":{"type":"integer"}}}}},"required":["department","slots"]},"consequential":false},{"name":"estimate_procedure_cost","description":"Return the hospital's package estimate for a procedure, and what the policy would leave payable.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"procedure":{"type":"string"},"room_category":{"type":"string","enum":["general","semi_private","private"]}},"required":["procedure","room_category"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"procedure":{"type":"string"},"package_estimate":{"type":"integer"},"room_rent_per_day":{"type":"integer"},"typical_stay_days":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["procedure","package_estimate","room_rent_per_day"]},"consequential":false},{"name":"lookup_patient_record","description":"Retrieve patient registration, department history and any open appointment.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^PT-[0-9]{4}$"}},"required":["patient_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"string"},"registered":{"type":"boolean"},"open_appointment":{"type":"boolean"},"last_visit_days":{"type":"integer"},"department":{"type":"string"}},"required":["patient_id","registered","open_appointment"]},"consequential":false},{"name":"lookup_policy_coverage","description":"Retrieve insurer, sum insured, room-rent cap, waiting periods and remaining balance.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"patient_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^PT-[0-9]{4}$"},"policy_no":{"type":"string"}},"required":["patient_id","policy_no"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"insurer":{"type":"string"},"sum_insured":{"type":"integer"},"balance":{"type":"integer"},"room_rent_cap":{"type":"integer"},"waiting_period_active":{"type":"boolean"},"network_hospital":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["insurer","sum_insured","balance","network_hospital"]},"consequential":false},{"name":"submit_preauth_request","description":